  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.63,
      "e": 2.23,
      "text": "Hi, Bethany Stevens here"
    },
    {
      "s": 2.23,
      "e": 4.07,
      "text": "coming to you from NASA’s Headquarters"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.07,
      "e": 6.4,
      "text": "with your NASA Minute update."
    },
    {
      "s": 6.4,
      "e": 8.63,
      "text": "NASA was hard at work this week to keep America"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.63,
      "e": 10.3,
      "text": "First on the final frontier."
    },
    {
      "s": 10.3,
      "e": 11.97,
      "text": "Let's dive in!"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.97,
      "e": 14.27,
      "text": "On Wednesday, acting NASA Administrator"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.27,
      "e": 15.43,
      "text": "Sean Duffy joined"
    },
    {
      "s": 15.43,
      "e": 17.1,
      "text": "President Trump at the White House"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.1,
      "e": 18.7,
      "text": "for the signing of an Executive Order"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.7,
      "e": 20.5,
      "text": "that reduces regulatory barriers"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.5,
      "e": 22.5,
      "text": "on commercial space launches."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.5,
      "e": 24.3,
      "text": "This is a crucial step to ensure"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.3,
      "e": 25.43,
      "text": "the United States remains"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.43,
      "e": 27.2,
      "text": "a global leader in space!"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.2,
      "e": 28.6,
      "text": "Under President Trump's leadership,"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.6,
      "e": 31.6,
      "text": "we will win the second space race."
    },
    {
      "s": 31.77,
      "e": 33.87,
      "text": "Artemis II’s Orion spacecraft"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.87,
      "e": 36.0,
      "text": "completed a short but important journey"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.0,
      "e": 38.27,
      "text": "from the Multipurpose Payload Facility"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.27,
      "e": 40.33,
      "text": "to the Launch Abort System Facility"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.33,
      "e": 43.13,
      "text": "at Kennedy Space Center in Florida."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.13,
      "e": 45.0,
      "text": "With fueling of the spacecraft complete,"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.0,
      "e": 46.17,
      "text": "the spacecraft is one"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.17,
      "e": 48.67,
      "text": "step closer to the launch pad as engineers"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.67,
      "e": 51.03,
      "text": "prepare its launch abort system."
    },
    {
      "s": 51.03,
      "e": 52.57,
      "text": "Also this week, the Artemis"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.57,
      "e": 54.23,
      "text": "II crew practiced operations"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.23,
      "e": 55.6,
      "text": "at the Florida spaceport"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.6,
      "e": 57.4,
      "text": "for different scenarios they could face"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.4,
      "e": 59.37,
      "text": "if their launch occurs at night."
    },
    {
      "s": 59.37,
      "e": 61.43,
      "text": "NASA’s James Webb Space Telescope"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.43,
      "e": 63.6,
      "text": "has now found strong evidence for a planet"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.6,
      "e": 66.07,
      "text": "in the closest star system to us, which,"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.07,
      "e": 68.27,
      "text": "if confirmed, would be the closest planet"
    },
    {
      "s": 68.27,
      "e": 70.43,
      "text": "to Earth that orbits in the habitable"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.43,
      "e": 72.0,
      "text": "zone of a Sun-like star."
    },
    {
      "s": 73.0,
      "e": 75.3,
      "text": "Phase 2 of the LunaRecycle challenge"
    },
    {
      "s": 75.3,
      "e": 77.17,
      "text": "just opened for American innovators"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.17,
      "e": 79.3,
      "text": "to submit solutions for recycling common"
    },
    {
      "s": 79.3,
      "e": 80.3,
      "text": "trash materials –"
    },
    {
      "s": 80.3,
      "e": 83.77,
      "text": "like fabrics, plastics, foam, and metals –"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.77,
      "e": 85.2,
      "text": "that can accumulate on"
    },
    {
      "s": 85.2,
      "e": 87.63,
      "text": "long duration lunar missions."
    },
    {
      "s": 87.63,
      "e": 89.77,
      "text": "Through pairing industry innovation with NASA"
    },
    {
      "s": 89.77,
      "e": 91.63,
      "text": "expertise, we will ensure"
    },
    {
      "s": 91.63,
      "e": 94.63,
      "text": "American leadership on the Moon and beyond!"
    },
    {
      "s": 95.2,
      "e": 98.57,
      "text": "And finally, NASA's RAVEN Project, a 1,000 pound"
    },
    {
      "s": 98.57,
      "e": 101.9,
      "text": "class unmanned research aircraft, is performing"
    },
    {
      "s": 101.9,
      "e": 103.53,
      "text": "wind tunnel tests on a scale model"
    },
    {
      "s": 103.53,
      "e": 106.0,
      "text": "wing to generate flight dynamics data"
    },
    {
      "s": 106.0,
      "e": 107.77,
      "text": "to help air taxi manufacturers"
    },
    {
      "s": 107.77,
      "e": 110.77,
      "text": "build safer, more stable aircraft."
    },
    {
      "s": 110.97,
      "e": 112.5,
      "text": "That’s our NASA minute."
    },
    {
      "s": 112.5,
      "e": 113.63,
      "text": "We’re going to keep working"
    },
    {
      "s": 113.63,
      "e": 115.9,
      "text": "to unlock the Golden Age of Human Space"
    },
    {
      "s": 115.9,
      "e": 117.9,
      "text": "Exploration and Innovation."
    },
    {
      "s": 117.9,
      "e": 119.33,
      "text": "Follow along here and across"
    },
    {
      "s": 119.33,
      "e": 121.0,
      "text": "NASA’s social media channels"
    },
    {
      "s": 121.0,
      "e": 123.7,
      "text": "to stay up to date as we make history together!"
    }
